## So sánh các Patterns

| Aspect | Clean Architecture | Hexagonal | CQRS | Event Sourcing | DDD |
|--------|-------------------|-----------|------|----------------|-----|
| **Primary Focus** | Layer separation | Port/Adapter decoupling | Read/Write separation | State as events | Domain modeling |
| **Dependency Direction** | Inward only | Inward (core) | Bidirectional (via events) | Inward (domain) | Bounded contexts inward |
| **Best For** | General purpose | External system swaps | Different R/W patterns | Audit trails | Complex domains |
| **Complexity** | Medium | Medium | High | High | Medium-High |
| **Testing** | Easy (layers isolated) | Very easy (ports mockable) | Moderate | Moderate | Moderate |
| **State Management** | Current state only | Current state only | Separate models | Full event history | Current state |
| **Reconstruction** | N/A | N/A | Via projections | Full replay | N/A |
| **Team Size** | Any | Any | 3+ recommended | 3+ recommended | 2+ recommended |
| **Storage** | Standard DB | Standard DB | Separate R/W DBs | Event store | Standard DB |
| **Eventual Consistency** | Optional | Optional | Common | Native | Optional |

### Complementary Usage

Các patterns có thể được kết hợp:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Combined Architecture                          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                  │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │                    Presentation Layer                       │ │
│  │               (REST API, GraphQL, CLI)                       │ │
│  └───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────┘ │
│                              │                                    │
│  ┌───────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │               Application Layer (CQRS)                      │ │
│  │           Commands/Queries → Event Handlers                  │ │
│  └───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────┘ │
│                              │                                    │
│  ┌───────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │                    Domain Layer (DDD)                       │ │
│  │     Aggregates, Entities, Value Objects, Domain Events      │ │
│  └───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────┘ │
│                              │                                    │
│  ┌───────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │              Infrastructure (Hexagonal + Clean)              │ │
│  │              Ports/Adapters, Repositories                   │ │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                                                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

