## Workflow - Tổng hợp

### Phase 1: Strategic Design (DDD + Clean Architecture)

1. Meet with domain experts
2. Identify bounded contexts
3. Define ubiquitous language
4. Map context integration
5. Design layer structure

### Phase 2: Tactical Design (DDD + Hexagonal)

1. Define aggregates within contexts
2. Identify entities and value objects
3. Design ports (interfaces)
4. Plan adapters
5. Define domain events

### Phase 3: Implementation (CQRS + Event Sourcing)

1. Design command and query models
2. Implement aggregates with events
3. Build projections for queries
4. Set up event store
5. Implement read models

### Phase 4: Integration (All Patterns)

1. Wire adapters to ports
2. Configure dependency injection
3. Set up event bus
4. Implement CQRS handlers
5. Add monitoring

### Phase 5: Testing (All Patterns)

1. Unit test domain logic
2. Integration test adapters
3. Test projections
4. Test eventual consistency
5. Performance testing

